<https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/evidence/morphoeval-meinhardt-echinoderm-pentaradial-symmetry-measurement-continuous-nodal-bmp2-4-dose-response-max-expected-podia-discrete-law-3-over-wt-nodal-mo-and-bilateral-gof-doses> a schema:PropertyValue,
